---
description: >-
  classDiagram-v2 with three classes (User, Admin, Report) declared together inside a single
  namespace block, with relationships between them declared afterward, outside the namespace
  block.
---
classDiagram-v2
namespace Company.Project.Module {
  class User {
    +login(username: String, password: String)
    +logout()
  }
  class Admin {
    +addUser(user: User)
    +removeUser(user: User)
    +generateReport()
  }
  class Report {
    +generatePDF(reportData: List)
    +generateCSV(reportData: List)
  }
}
Admin --> User : manages
Admin --> Report : generates
